    "businessAssertions":  [
                               "Fuxing Bank operations console covers 28 clearing, reconciliation, and end-of-day states from PV-0136 through PV-0163.",
                               "Clearing monitoring aggregates persisted clearing_payment and transfer_order records and does not expose an unsupported artificial batch trigger.",
                               "Reconciliation executes three real ledger paths and persists difference results.",
                               "End-of-day processing uses a database transaction lock and idempotency key so repeated requests do not create duplicate runs.",
                               "The source images for PV0138 and PV0147 conflict with their filename states; the baseline follows filename state, the unified operations shell, and the real business contract.",
                               "Visual fixtures are deterministic synthetic data and contain no real personal data or secrets."
